CREATE TABLE "Product" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"marketplace" TEXT NOT NULL,"externalId" TEXT NOT NULL,"name" TEXT NOT NULL,"description" TEXT,"category" TEXT,"subcategory" TEXT,"shopId" TEXT,"shopName" TEXT,"productUrl" TEXT NOT NULL,"affiliateUrl" TEXT,"imageUrl" TEXT,"currentPrice" DECIMAL(14,2),"affiliateRate" DECIMAL(8,4),"reviewScore" DECIMAL(4,2),"reviewCount" INTEGER,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL);
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "Product_marketplace_externalId_key" ON "Product"("marketplace","externalId");
CREATE TABLE "ProductSnapshot" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"productId" TEXT NOT NULL,"capturedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"price" DECIMAL(14,2),"affiliateRate" DECIMAL(8,4),"reviewScore" DECIMAL(4,2),"reviewCount" INTEGER,"available" BOOLEAN,CONSTRAINT "ProductSnapshot_productId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("productId") REFERENCES "Product"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE);
CREATE TABLE "TrackingGroup" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"measurementName" TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,"rakutenTrackingId" TEXT);
CREATE TABLE "AffiliateLink" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"productId" TEXT NOT NULL,"trackingGroupId" TEXT,"url" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CONSTRAINT "AffiliateLink_productId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("productId") REFERENCES "Product"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE,CONSTRAINT "AffiliateLink_trackingGroupId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("trackingGroupId") REFERENCES "TrackingGroup"("id"));
CREATE TABLE "Pin" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"pinterestPinId" TEXT UNIQUE,"productId" TEXT NOT NULL,"affiliateLinkId" TEXT,"title" TEXT NOT NULL,"description" TEXT,"board" TEXT,"language" TEXT,"targetMarket" TEXT,"publishedAt" TIMESTAMP(3),"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'draft',CONSTRAINT "Pin_productId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("productId") REFERENCES "Product"("id"),CONSTRAINT "Pin_affiliateLinkId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("affiliateLinkId") REFERENCES "AffiliateLink"("id"));
CREATE TABLE "PinSnapshot" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"pinId" TEXT NOT NULL,"capturedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"impressions" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,"pinClicks" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,"outboundClicks" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,"saves" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,"engagement" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,CONSTRAINT "PinSnapshot_pinId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("pinId") REFERENCES "Pin"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE);
CREATE TABLE "Order" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"externalId" TEXT,"marketplace" TEXT NOT NULL,"measurementName" TEXT,"orderedAt" TIMESTAMP(3),"salesAmount" DECIMAL(14,2),"status" TEXT,"rawData" JSONB,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
CREATE TABLE "Commission" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"orderId" TEXT,"amount" DECIMAL(14,2) NOT NULL,"currency" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'JPY',"status" TEXT,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CONSTRAINT "Commission_orderId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("orderId") REFERENCES "Order"("id"));
CREATE TABLE "Experiment" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"name" TEXT NOT NULL,"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'draft',"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
CREATE TABLE "ImportRun" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"source" TEXT NOT NULL,"filename" TEXT NOT NULL,"status" TEXT NOT NULL,"rowCount" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
CREATE TABLE "ModelRun" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"modelVersion" TEXT NOT NULL,"trainingRows" INTEGER NOT NULL,"features" JSONB NOT NULL,"metrics" JSONB,"parameters" JSONB,"trainedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
CREATE TABLE "Recommendation" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"productId" TEXT,"score" DECIMAL(8,4),"reasons" JSONB,"risks" JSONB,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
CREATE INDEX "Product_marketplace_category_idx" ON "Product"("marketplace","category");
CREATE INDEX "ProductSnapshot_productId_capturedAt_idx" ON "ProductSnapshot"("productId","capturedAt");
CREATE INDEX "PinSnapshot_pinId_capturedAt_idx" ON "PinSnapshot"("pinId","capturedAt");
CREATE INDEX "Order_marketplace_externalId_idx" ON "Order"("marketplace","externalId");
